{"seq":2,"slug":"benefit-cost-roi-measurement","title":"权益成本、负债与 ROI 度量：核销率与增量收益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/retention-measurement-ops/benefit-cost-roi-measurement","wordCount":2948,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"权益成本-负债与-roi-度量-核销率与增量收益\">权益成本、负债与 ROI 度量：核销率与增量收益</h1><p>一个 12 万会员的跨境品牌把「金卡免运费」的年度预算报成 180 万元，年底实际花了 310 万元——差出来的 130 万里只有约 40 万是真实的运费支出，其余是<strong>从未被核销的权益在会计上被当成收入、又被重新计了一次口径</strong>。权益成本至少分裂成四个量：<strong>已核销成本</strong>（会员真用掉，企业真掏钱）、<strong>呆滞与负债</strong>（发了没核销，钱没花但账上挂着义务）、<strong>履约成本</strong>（每核销一次的运营开销）与<strong>体验与营销成本</strong>（内容、触达、客服）。本文讲清：<strong>权益如何被计成负债而非费用</strong>、<strong>核销率与增量收益如何被度量</strong>、<strong>ROI 如何做盈亏平衡判断</strong>。它承接<a href=\"../benefit-catalog-entitlement/benefit-catalog-taxonomy\">权益目录分类与建模</a>的原子权益项，并复用<a href=\"../benefit-redemption-fulfillment/benefit-redemption-entitlement-checkout\">结算核销</a>产生的账本事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>重大权利（material right）</strong>：客户不签该合同就拿不到的额外权利，会计上构成<strong>单独履约义务</strong>，收入必须递延。</li>\n<li><strong>合同负债 / 呆滞（contract liability / breakage）</strong>：已收对价中尚未履约的部分即合同负债；呆滞是其中预计永不核销、确认时点取决于企业是否预期有权保留的那部分。</li>\n<li><strong>核销率 / 增量收益</strong>：前者是某授予批次中已被使用的权益占比（须绑定观察窗口），后者是扣除反事实后真实多出来的收益（只能由留出组或合成控制测得）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么权益是负债而不是费用-material-right\">为什么权益是负债而不是费用：material right</h2><p>权益在发放那一刻，企业并没有「花掉一笔钱」，而是<strong>欠了会员一项未来的履约义务</strong>——会计上叫<strong>重大权利（material right）</strong>。IFRS 15 结论基础段 B39 规定，若企业授予客户「若不签订该合同就不会获得的重大权利」，该权利构成<strong>单独履约义务</strong>（来源：<a href=\"https://www.iasplus.com/en/standards/ifrs/ifrs15\">IFRS 15.B39, IAS Plus</a>）；B40 要求只能在<strong>未来商品或服务被转让、或该权利失效时</strong>确认收入。换言之，一张「下次免运费」的券发出的当天对应的是<strong>合同负债</strong>而非当期成本。初始交易价格要按<strong>相对单独售价</strong>分摊一部分给它（B41），无单独售价时用<strong>增量折扣额 × 预计行使概率</strong>估计。这里有个常被踩的坑——B43 明确，<strong>面向同类客户普遍可得的折扣属于营销要约而非重大权利</strong>，直接在行使时处理即可；把「所有会员都能领的 9 折」错记成必须分摊的 material right，会让负债虚高、收入被不合理递延。</p>\n<p>呆滞的处理决定负债何时释放。B44–B45 规定：若企业<strong>预期</strong>自己有权保留永不核销的部分，它应按<strong>客户实际行使权利的同一模式、按比例确认</strong>为收入；若<strong>不预期</strong>能保留，则要等到「客户行使剩余权利的可能性变得极为遥远」时才一次性确认。按比例确认让收入平滑释放，而「极不可能」标准大概率意味着负债要挂到权益过期日之后很久。税务侧还有一层：美国多州的**无人认领财产法（unclaimed property / escheatment）**要求企业把未核销的预付余额（含部分礼品卡与储值）移交州政府（来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breakage_(accounting)\">Breakage (accounting), Wikipedia</a>），因此「breakage 是纯利」的直觉在跨境场景下并不总成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权益的四类成本-分开记账才不会互相掩盖\">权益的四类成本：分开记账才不会互相掩盖</h2><p>把权益成本压成一个「总预算」数字，是 ROI 永远算不准的根因。四类成本口径、驱动因素、优化手段都不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本类</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>计量口径</th>\n<th>主要驱动因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已核销成本</td>\n<td>会员实际使用权益产生的直接支出</td>\n<td>按核销事件合计</td>\n<td>核销率 × 单次权益成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>呆滞与负债</td>\n<td>已授予未核销部分的义务现值</td>\n<td>期末合同负债余额</td>\n<td>授予量 − 核销量 − 已确认 breakage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约成本</td>\n<td>每一次核销的运营开销</td>\n<td>按核销次数摊</td>\n<td>核销量、自动化程度、客服介入率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体验与营销成本</td>\n<td>让权益被认知、被使用的开销</td>\n<td>按期摊销</td>\n<td>触达频次、内容制作、专属体验设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>压低<strong>已核销成本</strong>最直接的办法是抬高核销门槛，但门槛抬高会同时压低核销率——<strong>核销率下降</strong>看似省钱，实则是把成本推给<strong>呆滞与负债</strong>；放宽核销又会让履约成本随核销次数线性放大。真正的杠杆是<strong>结构性设计</strong>：把高成本权益的核销路径自动化，把低成本权益的触达做透。</p>\n<p>任何一期的期末负债都由四个流量推出：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_t = L_{t-1} + G_t - R_t - B_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是新授予而递延的部分、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是核销而转确认的收入、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按比例确认的 breakage。这条恒等式一旦跑起来，「权益花了多少钱」就不再是靠估算的数字，而是一本可对账的账——也正是<a href=\"../benefit-redemption-fulfillment/voucher-issuance-wallet-ledger\">优惠券发放与钱包账本</a>必须保证账本事件不可变的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核销率与呆滞率-一对必须分开的孪生指标\">核销率与呆滞率：一对必须分开的孪生指标</h2><p><strong>核销率（redemption rate）<strong>度量「授予的权益里有多少被真正用掉」，但必须绑定</strong>观察窗口</strong>才有意义。同一批权益的首月核销率可能只有 22%，终身核销率（ultimate redemption rate）却可能到 71%——两个数字都对，混淆则会得出相反结论。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>核销率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>该批次已核销权益数</mtext><mtext>该批次已授予权益数</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>呆滞率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>ultimate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{核销率} = \\frac{\\text{该批次已核销权益数}}{\\text{该批次已授予权益数}}, \\qquad \\text{呆滞率} = 1 - R_{\\text{ultimate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">核销率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该批次已授予权益数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该批次已核销权益数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">呆滞率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ultimate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;授予批次 cohort 2026-01&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;按 30/60/90/180 天&lt;br/&gt;追踪累计核销&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;曲线是否已收敛?&quot;}&#10;  C -- 否 --&gt; D[&quot;外推 ultimate redemption R_∞&quot;]&#10;  C -- 是 --&gt; E[&quot;取末点作为 R_∞&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;呆滞率 = 1 - R_∞&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;按比例确认 breakage&lt;br/&gt;更新合同负债&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;重算该批次单位权益成本&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"授予批次 cohort 2026-01\"] --&gt; B[\"按 30/60/90/180 天&lt;br/&gt;追踪累计核销\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"曲线是否已收敛?\"}\n  C -- 否 --&gt; D[\"外推 ultimate redemption R_∞\"]\n  C -- 是 --&gt; E[\"取末点作为 R_∞\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"呆滞率 = 1 - R_∞\"]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[\"按比例确认 breakage&lt;br/&gt;更新合同负债\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"重算该批次单位权益成本\"]</pre><p>分母的选择比分子更讲究。用<strong>存量分母</strong>（当前总授予量）算出的核销率会被新授予严重稀释——促销月发放量翻倍，「核销率暴跌」其实只是分母变大；正确做法是<strong>按授予批次做同期群（cohort）追踪</strong>，看 1 月授予的权益在 1、2、3、6、12 个月后的累计核销曲线。订阅业务里通用同期群方法正是此理——聚合口径在快速增长的客户基数上会<strong>低估真实流失率</strong>（来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Churn_rate\">Churn rate, Wikipedia</a>）。核销曲线前期陡、尾部长，尾部越拖说明<strong>有效期</strong>给了会员足够长的「想起它」的机会，但也意味着负债要挂更久——这正是 IFRS 15 B44 要求<strong>可持续更新 breakage 估计</strong>的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量收益-从相关性到因果性\">增量收益：从相关性到因果性</h2><p>这是 ROI 度量里最容易造假的一环。核销过权益的会员复购率比没核销的高 40%——但这 40% 里有多少是<strong>权益带来的</strong>，有多少只是「本来就想买的人顺手用了券」？后者叫<strong>自选择偏差</strong>，它会把一笔纯补贴算成增长奇迹。因果性地度量增量只有两条路：</p>\n<p><strong>路一：留出组（holdout）。</strong> 在推出权益前<strong>保留一小部分用户完全不参与</strong>，测量期后比较两组差异——正确表述是「留一小片永远不会拿到任何改进的用户，一个季度后测量他们和其他人之间的差距」（来源：<a href=\"https://www.statsig.com/blog/beyond-the-a-b-test-blog-version\">Beyond the A/B Test, Statsig</a>）。对「多条权益同时生效」的引擎尤其关键：单权益 A/B 测出的 lift 在叠加后会相互侵蚀，唯有留出组能同时测出<strong>所有叠加权益的累计效应</strong>（见<a href=\"../benefit-catalog-entitlement/benefit-stacking-exclusion-conflict\">权益堆叠、互斥与冲突</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>路二：合成控制（synthetic control）。</strong> 当权益<strong>按市场整片投放</strong>、无法随机分配个人时，用若干未投放的相似市场加权构造「人工孪生市场」，真实市场与孪生市场的差距就是增量（来源同上）。跨境场景典型如「东南亚站点先上，欧美站点作对照」——但站点间的季节性、汇率、物流延迟差异会让孪生市场失真，必须做协变量匹配。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>增量 GMV</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>处理组</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>对照组</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>相对增量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>处理组</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>对照组</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>对照组</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{增量 GMV} = Y_{\\text{处理组}} - Y_{\\text{对照组}}, \\qquad \\text{相对增量} = \\frac{Y_{\\text{处理组}} - Y_{\\text{对照组}}}{Y_{\\text{对照组}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增量</span><span class=\"mord\"> GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">处理组</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">对照组</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">相对增量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">对照组</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">处理组</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">对照组</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>留出组有两个被低估的陷阱：其一是<strong>样本量与最小可检测效应（MDE）的权衡</strong>——比例越大检测越灵敏但放弃的收益越多，太小（如 1%）则只有非常大的效应才能被显著检出，容易误判「没有增量」；其二是<strong>观测窗口</strong>——留出组通常要覆盖完整业务周期（含至少一次大促），否则大促期的增量会被平滑掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"roi-盈亏平衡与分层定价的判断\">ROI、盈亏平衡与分层定价的判断</h2><p>有了单位权益成本和增量收益，ROI 才有可算的形式。权益项目的 ROI 不是「增量 GMV ÷ 权益成本」——那会忽略毛利：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ROI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>毛利率</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>项目</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>项目</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ROI} = \\frac{\\Delta \\text{GMV} \\times \\text{毛利率} - C_{\\text{项目}}}{C_{\\text{项目}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ROI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">项目</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">毛利率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">项目</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>项目</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{项目}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">项目</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是四类成本的合计。这条式子立刻暴露一个常见误区：<strong>毛利率越低的品类，权益越难正 ROI</strong>。同样 5% 的增量 GMV，毛利率 45% 的自有品牌能覆盖权益成本，毛利率 12% 的 3C 标品则可能覆盖不了——所以分层定价（会员价、专享折扣）必须按<strong>品类毛利</strong>而非统一比例设计。</p>\n<p>盈亏平衡的临界增量可直接反解：设单位会员权益成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、期望增量利润为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\cdot \\Delta g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 为毛利率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 为增量 GMV），保本条件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\cdot \\Delta g \\geq c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>g</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta g^{*} = \\dfrac{c}{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。「每个会员要额外多买多少钱才不亏」把权益设计从「感觉有价值」逼回数字：免运费权益的真实成本若为每单 4.2 美元，在 30% 毛利下需每位持权会员多贡献 <strong>14 美元</strong>增量 GMV 才保本，一旦高于该层级会员的平均客单，方案就该重做。</p>\n<p>长期视角用 LTV 与留存率收口。Stripe 把订阅客户的 LTV 定义为「ARPU 除以流失率」，并用同期群追踪<strong>收入留存率</strong>——由于升级扩购，它可以超过 100%（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/analytics\">Stripe Billing analytics</a>）；经典 LTV 公式是「(月均收入 × 毛利率) ÷ 月流失率」（来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Customer_lifetime_value\">Customer lifetime value, Wikipedia</a>）。权益提升的正是留存率这个分母：会员流失率从 9% 降到 7%，LTV 立刻放大。核销率、呆滞率、增量 lift 也必须在报表、财务、运营三方之间<strong>共用一套口径</strong>，否则同一项权益会出现三个互相打架的 ROI；真相源应落在与<a href=\"../tier-state-lifecycle-model/tier-qualification-recalculation-engine\">等级资格重算引擎</a>同一套事件账本之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>权益发放即产生<strong>合同负债</strong>而非当期费用：material right 按相对单独售价分摊、递延至核销或权利失效（IFRS 15 B39–B43）。</li>\n<li><strong>呆滞有两条确认路径</strong>：预期能保留则按核销比例确认，不预期保留则等到剩余权利「极为遥远」时才确认；跨境还要考虑多州的无人认领财产移交义务。</li>\n<li>成本必须拆成<strong>已核销 / 呆滞与负债 / 履约 / 体验营销</strong>四类；压核销门槛只会把成本转移到负债科目。</li>\n<li><strong>核销率必须按批次做同期群追踪</strong>并外推到 ultimate redemption rate，聚合分母会低估真实呆滞。</li>\n<li><strong>增量收益只能由反事实测得</strong>：留出组测累计效应，合成控制测整市场投放；核销者与未核销者的对比藏有自选择偏差。</li>\n<li>ROI 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>毛利率</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mi>C</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\Delta \\text{GMV} \\times \\text{毛利率} - C}{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">毛利率</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 度量，盈亏平衡增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>g</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta g^{*} = c/m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 超过该层会员平均客单时，方案就要重做。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"权益成本、负债与 ROI 度量：核销率与增量收益","id":"权益成本-负债与-roi-度量-核销率与增量收益"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么权益是负债而不是费用：material right","id":"为什么权益是负债而不是费用-material-right"},{"level":2,"text":"权益的四类成本：分开记账才不会互相掩盖","id":"权益的四类成本-分开记账才不会互相掩盖"},{"level":2,"text":"核销率与呆滞率：一对必须分开的孪生指标","id":"核销率与呆滞率-一对必须分开的孪生指标"},{"level":2,"text":"增量收益：从相关性到因果性","id":"增量收益-从相关性到因果性"},{"level":2,"text":"ROI、盈亏平衡与分层定价的判断","id":"roi-盈亏平衡与分层定价的判断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"会员流失、续费与留存：队列分析与挽留触达","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/retention-measurement-ops/membership-churn-renewal-retention"},"next":{"title":"等级与权益配置治理：版本、审计与分层实验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/retention-measurement-ops/tier-config-governance-ab-experiment"}}